# Combo Challenge (run combo): the clock runs (6 s here instead of 60) and only the best single
# combo counts: Kickflip + FS Powerslide (490) beats the later Kickflip (100); the score still adds
# both, but the result is the best (comboOver best 490).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
cmd 0 setData run.combo.seconds 6
cmd 0 run combo
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+left 96
hold slide 208..280
hold ollie 450..480
tap flip+left 486
run 900
expect event comboStart{seconds=6} within 1..2
expect event comboLanded{points=490} within 250..300
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip,points=100} within 590..630
expect event comboOver{best=490,score=590} within 720..760
expect session.mode == over at end
